# Keep the Vercel deploy small and torch-free. Root Directory = repo root; the
# build runs `npm run vercel-build` (builds web/ -> web/dist) and bundles
# api/ as the Python function. The torch checkpoints / training code / pyproject
# (which the uv Python builder would read and install torch from) are dropped.
/requirements.txt
/requirements-dev.txt
/pyproject.toml

# training / research / data — never needed at runtime
/checkpoints
/data
/results
/experiments
/scripts
/tests
/docs
/notebooks
/Egaroucid-console_v7.8.1
/Egaroucid-console*
*.pt
*.ipynb

web/node_modules
web/dist
node_modules
.git
